d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람이","audio":"/audio/3f33d9d6ca9be288c4e3.mp3"}},{"text":"술","meaning":"酒","explanation":"술：酒","readings":[{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65157","senseId":"1","lemma":"술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"술","audio":"/audio/803d2c68651ceceab94d.mp3"}},{"text":"한잔","meaning":"一杯，一盅","explanation":"한잔：一杯，一盅","readings":[{"term":"한잔","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72462","senseId":"1","lemma":"한잔","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한잔","audio":"/audio/b94a4dfc6a50694d1d0d.mp3"}},{"text":"사기로","meaning":"请客，付账，买单","explanation":"사다：请客，付账，买单；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"5","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사기로","audio":"/audio/55e295a86e5dba53515e.mp3"}},{"text":"하자.","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하자","audio":"/audio/04b9b32cf095cdd41c5b.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"行，可以","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某个行动或事情等不成问题。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"输","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"63606","definition":"在比赛或战争中败给对方。","pronunciation":["지다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"803d2c68651cecea","term":"술","zh":"酒","audio":"/aud